1
00:00:00,765 --> 00:00:02,333
This video is for doctors.

2
00:00:02,333 --> 00:00:08,664
You will learn how to review and approve your requests, read your report, follow your patients' lab work,

3
00:00:08,664 --> 00:00:10,775
and answer the satisfaction survey.

4
00:00:11,226 --> 00:00:15,646
Open the system link, write your name and password, and tap Sign in.

5
00:00:16,937 --> 00:00:22,962
Every 50 days, a short satisfaction survey opens for ten days. It appears when you sign in.

6
00:00:22,962 --> 00:00:28,788
Tap the stars, choose a number from zero to ten, write a note if you like, and tap Send.

7
00:00:28,788 --> 00:00:32,827
If you tap Later, a notice stays at the top until you answer.

8
00:00:33,278 --> 00:00:37,819
Your page opens on Reviews. The cards at the top count your requests:

9
00:00:37,819 --> 00:00:45,058
waiting for your review, approved, sent to the branch, and received. Tap any card to show only those requests.

10
00:00:45,510 --> 00:00:50,910
Tap a request to open it. You see each item and the quantity the nurse asked for.

11
00:00:51,361 --> 00:00:57,531
If a quantity is too much or too little, change it. You can also write a note on any item.

12
00:00:57,981 --> 00:01:03,741
Then tap Approve. The request goes to procurement right away, and the nurse can follow it.

13
00:01:04,192 --> 00:01:07,772
If something is wrong, write the reason and tap Reject.

14
00:01:07,772 --> 00:01:11,872
The request goes back to the nurse to fix it and send it again.

15
00:01:14,352 --> 00:01:19,802
Tap Requests report to see what you ordered. Choose one month, or cumulative until a date.

16
00:01:20,253 --> 00:01:26,593
The report shows each request with its items and quantities. You can print it or save it as PDF.

17
00:01:27,050 --> 00:01:32,860
On the Lab page, you follow your patients' lab work: where each case is now, and when it is due.

18
00:01:33,554 --> 00:01:39,774
To change your password, tap the lock icon at the bottom, then write the old and the new password.

19
00:01:40,225 --> 00:01:46,515
That's it. Please review your requests quickly, so your clinic gets its supplies on time. Thank you!
